<h3 id=3D"complexity-analysis">Complexity Analysis</h3>
<p><strong>Time complexity:</strong> The time complexity of <code>substring=
_anagrams</code> is <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><mat=
h xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><=
mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo></mrow><=
annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">O(n)</annotation></semantics></ma=
th></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"ba=
se"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"><=
/span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margin-right: 0.02778em;">O<=
/span><span class=3D"mopen">(</span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span=
><span class=3D"mclose">)</span></span></span></span>, where <span class=3D=
"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/=
Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"appl=
ication/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex=
-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" styl=
e=3D"height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span></sp=
an></span></span> denotes the length of <code>s</code>. Here=E2=80=99s why:=
</p>
<ul>
<li>Populating the <code>expected_freqs</code> array takes <span class=3D"k=
atex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Ma=
th/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>m</m=
i><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x=
-tex">O(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html"=
 aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"h=
