an></span></span> time, where m denotes the length of t. Since <span class=
=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/19=
98/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"a=
pplication/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"ka=
tex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" s=
