 class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span=
 class=3D"mopen">(</span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span><span clas=
s=3D"mclose">)</span></span></span></span> time.</li>
<li>Note that at each iteration, the comparison performed between the two f=
